  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The Pruning of London Plane tree (T7) in the front garden, subject to Tree Preservation Order TPO/8/3/69, shall comprise only the following and must be carried out in accordance with British Standard BS3998:2010:\r\n\r\n- by re-pollarding the tree back to the historic primary pruning points (up to 20cm diameter at pollard point) at approximately the height of the first-floor bay window gutter.\r\n\r\nReason: In accordance with Policies DC8 and OS5 of the Local Plan (2018)",
    "Condition : 2 - No less than five working days' notice shall be given to the Council's Aboricultural Officer before any work commences to the tree (Telephone 020 8753 3407). \r\n\r\nReason: In order that the Council has the opportunity to ensure that the work is carried out in accordance with Condition 1, in accordance with Policies DC8 and OS5 of the Local Plan (2018)\r\n"
